    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a sleek, modern, abstract representation of financial market data overlaid with subtle, artistic elements suggesting space exploration and global connectivity. The composition includes upward-trending graphs, stylized stock tickers, a faint outline of a rocket or satellite in the background, and a world map subtly integrated, highlighting key financial hubs and tech centers across India, the US, UK, Canada, and Australia. The color palette should be professional, with blues, silvers, and subtle futuristic accents, avoiding a generic stock photo look. Focus on the concept of 'signals' and 'strategy' rather than just a rocket.",
