    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the 'dual-price equity strategy' in AI startups. Imagine a large, translucent, iridescent bubble, symbolizing a valuation bubble, with two distinct, glowing internal layers or segments. One segment is vibrant and elevated, representing the higher investor valuation, while the other is subtly darker and grounded, representing the lower founder/employee share price. Intertwined within the bubble are faint, glowing neural network lines, hinting at AI technology. The bubble should appear delicate yet intriguing, set against a softly blurred, futuristic, professional-looking background with muted tech elements. The overall mood should convey both innovation and a sense of underlying tension or scrutiny, with a slightly upward dynamic to suggest growth, but also fragility.",
