    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the intense competition and contrasting scale between the IPL and FIFA World Cup in 2026. On one side, a vibrant, stadium-lit cricket pitch with blurred, energetic crowd, symbolizing IPL's domestic intensity. On the other, a vast, more globally diffused football stadium with diverse, multicultural silhouettes, representing the FIFA World Cup's international reach (USA, Canada, Mexico skylines faintly visible). A subtle visual overlay of upward-trending graphs or bar charts symbolizing 'viewership' and 'revenue' with one clearly dominating the other in a specific region, using a dynamic, modern graphic style with an abstract 'X' or 'vs.' element in the center. Focus on dynamic light, rich colors, and a sense of motion, avoiding specific team logos or exact player likenesses. Emphasize the abstract idea of a sporting contest with underlying data.",
