    featuredImagePrompt: "A high-angle, dynamic shot of the National Stock Exchange (NSE) building in Mumbai, India, at dusk. The building facade subtly integrates data visualizations and upward-trending stock charts, symbolizing growth and digital finance. In the foreground, hands of diverse investors (some holding smartphones with trading apps, others looking at a tablet displaying market data) are reaching towards the building, representing anticipation and global interest. The scene should convey scale, technological advancement, and the convergence of domestic and international investment. Emphasize vibrant, yet professional, lighting.",
