    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing data privacy under siege. Focus on abstract elements: a digital shield cracking, binary code or data particles escaping into a dark, swirling void. Incorporate subtle hints of a network infrastructure and biometric data (like fragmented facial outlines) being compromised. The overall mood should be urgent and vulnerable, with a global feel, perhaps a faint, abstract map overlay. Use cool blues, purples, and reds to signify danger and digital threat. Avoid literal depictions of people or company logos. Emphasize the abstract concept of digital information flowing uncontrollably.",
