    featuredImagePrompt: "A realistic, wide-angle depiction of a coastal landscape at sunset, but with unsettling atmospheric conditions. The ocean water near the shore is an unusual, unnaturally warm hue, with subtle ripples of heat haze visible just above the surface. In the distant sky, dark, heavy clouds gather, hinting at extreme weather, but without being overtly stormy. A faint, almost sickly orange glow permeates the horizon, reflecting off the water, giving a sense of unease. The composition should convey a sense of a planet under stress, focusing on the interplay of land, sea, and sky. No visible human structures or people. The overall mood is one of concern and impending change, emphasizing the climate crisis.",
