    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the Indian Premier League's (IPL) billion-dollar valuation and global expansion. Imagine a stylized cricket ball as a globe, with vibrant lines and arcs emanating from it, symbolizing financial growth and international reach. Overlay subtle digital data streams and rising bar graphs in the background, all rendered in a futuristic, energetic aesthetic. The colors should be dynamic, suggesting prosperity and movement, with iconic landmarks from India (e.g., India Gate), the U.S. (e.g., Statue of Liberty), UK (e.g., London Eye), Canada (e.g., CN Tower), and Australia (e.g., Sydney Opera House) subtly integrated into the global network of lines. Avoid any specific team logos or player faces to ensure broad appeal and uniqueness. Focus on the abstract concept of wealth and worldwide influence, with a sense of upward trajectory.",
