    featuredImagePrompt: "A sophisticated editorial news layout visually representing the multifaceted AI landscape. The composition features a central, abstract representation of a neural network with glowing nodes, symbolizing innovation. Around it, elements are dynamically arranged: on the left, an upward-trending stock graph with subtle digital currency symbols (investment surge); on the right, a translucent watermark icon overlaid on blurred digital text, alongside a small scale balancing 'innovation' and 'ethics' (ethical debates). In the background, a faint, interconnected global map pattern. The overall aesthetic is clean, professional, and futuristic, using a color palette of deep blues, electric purples, and silver accents, suggesting a cutting-edge news report. Sharp focus and high detail.",
