      vestingAnalysis: "Vesting analysis is not applicable to Securitize as a publicly traded company. Instead, we focus on market adoption and demand drivers for tokenized assets. The growth in tokenized AUM to $4.3 billion and a 147% jump in transaction volume on Securitize\'s platform underscore rising interest, but the earnings shortfall suggests that the conversion of this interest into stable revenue streams is still in its early, volatile stages.",
