      neutralCase: "SK Hynix is a well-positioned leader in a high-growth sector, but its recent stock surge indicates a high valuation. The Nasdaq listing will improve accessibility and provide capital, but the benefits might be offset by competitive pressures and the inherent cyclicality of the semiconductor industry. While AI demand is strong, the company must flawlessly execute its expansion plans and continue innovating to justify its premium. The listing is a positive step, but not without its challenges.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Strong Consider\' outlook with a weighted probability leaning bullish (60%) due to undeniable AI tailwinds and strategic positioning, tempered by competitive intensity and high valuation (30% neutral, 10% bearish). The improved investor access is a significant positive catalyst.",
