      bearCase: "The bullish technical pattern might fail to confirm, leading to further consolidation or a downtrend, especially if regulatory uncertainties (like the \'Clarity Act\') persist or worsen. Security concerns and broader macroeconomic headwinds could also trigger selling pressure, negating any bullish momentum.",
      neutralCase: "Bitcoin\'s price may remain range-bound, exhibiting \'boring\' price action, as the market weighs conflicting signals. The whale movement could be a one-off re-organization, and Bitget\'s expansion, while positive, might not immediately impact BTC\'s price. The unconfirmed technical pattern keeps investors on the sidelines, leading to sideways trading.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A moderately bullish outlook (55%) with significant upside potential if the technical pattern confirms and regulatory clarity improves. However, the unconfirmed nature of the pattern and persistent regulatory risks (45% probability of neutral/bearish outcome) warrant caution.",
