      neutralCase: "SK Hynix\'s Nasdaq listing is a well-timed strategic move, enhancing its global investor reach and funding critical AI-driven expansion. While the AI boom provides a strong tailwind, the company must deftly navigate fierce competition, potential market downturns, and complex operational challenges. Its success will depend on its ability to consistently innovate and execute its growth strategy amidst a dynamic and high-stakes global technology landscape.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "We assign a 60% probability to a Bull Case, 25% to a Neutral Case, and 15% to a Bear Case. The strong structural demand for AI, coupled with SK Hynix\'s market leadership and strategic capital raise, provides a significant advantage. However, the inherent risks of the semiconductor industry, competition, and execution cannot be entirely discounted.",
